        "short": "Jhené Aiko and Kendrick Lamar reunite on “So Good.”",
        "standard": "R&B is one of the most dynamic, adventurous sounds in modern music, a place where art both personal and provocative meets the mainstream. From the alt vanguard to modern vets, straightforward to left-field, these tracks capture where R&B is now and point the way to where it’s going. This week, <b>Jhené Aiko</b> and <b>Kendrick Lamar</b> are at the top of the playlist with <b>“So Good.”</b> The flirtatious track off Jhené’s latest album, <i>Westside Whimsy</i>, finds the duo trading verses about their chemistry and desire for each other on a deeper level. We update this playlist regularly. If you like a track, add it to your library."
